        "# ZeroDivisionError\n",
        "\n",
        "An [`ArithmeticError`](ArithmeticError.md) raised for division or modulo by zero.\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "id": "f47e5f5b9b0c0278",
      "metadata": {
      },
      "source": [
        "try:\n",
        "    10 / 0\n",
        "except ZeroDivisionError:\n",
        "    print('denominator must be nonzero')\n"
